{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_title", "source_sha256": "5a075392c271a0890ee44234e6e0640d3882348bb10e47b5f543b0426a1a573e", "ja": "フィナーレ！", "zh": "终幕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3b80cb3ab3ab7e3e1ad467eec3b2aba23e04780e872bb2efb4869c820d650057", "ja": "試写会での舞台挨拶を無事に終えた3人は、\n撮影の思い出や、本当に姉妹だったらと\nもしもの話を楽しそうに語る。そんな3人を\n見守りながら、プロデューサーは少し先の\n未来へと思いを馳せる。", "zh": "3人顺利完成了试映会上的舞台致辞，\n开心地聊着拍摄时的回忆，以及如果真的\n是姐妹会怎样的假设话题。制作人默默\n守望着这3人，思绪飘向\n不远的将来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1000_null", "source_sha256": "2fb45761dcb2195be04b31912a7d1331c12810ea2797fcbd3dfa32a1957cc3e3", "ja": "舞台挨拶　終了後……", "zh": "舞台问候　结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e6f5c1336d9262d3797c862380ef4f9840e0a8faac7acd10a8b57955392bc6b4", "ja": "みんな、試写会と挨拶、お疲れさま！\n撮影中の裏話も好評だったし、ばっちりだったよ。", "zh": "大家，试映会和见面会辛苦了！\n拍摄时的幕后花絮也大受好评，非常成功哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "1cca774a00550e97ab6d15d4a26874d28d8228c08548328dd160b23352791d52", "ja": "ええ。お客様方の反応がよくて、安心しました。\n特に、海美ちゃんのエピソード……。", "zh": "嗯。客人们的反响很好，我就放心了。  \n尤其是海美的那段故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "0fb010c35c795743fab942f7576426c3e785671f44d089ea1626da016c45c703", "ja": "あっ、私が育りんをおびえさせちゃった話？\nごめんね、なんか加減がよくわからなくて……。", "zh": "啊，是我把育りん吓到了的那件事？\n对不起哦，我总觉得掌握不好分寸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "8910a0435af0170895013fa393dc1ff413e8be4a9e17f9ef4a04b3991c7fa6cf", "ja": "最初はびっくりしちゃったけど、今はもう平気だよ！\n海美お姉さまは、とってもステキなお姉さまだもん♪", "zh": "一开始是吓了一跳，不过现在没事啦！\n海美大姐姐是非常棒的大姐姐嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "9a09eab91f1ecbdaf7faea542bfd0b868a363d03539407467412d0e063499391", "ja": "育りん……！　えへへっ。私も育りんのこと、\nカワイイ妹みたいに思ってるよーっ！", "zh": "育……！嘿嘿。我也把育当成可爱的妹妹一样哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "b866dd552965fe290f4743856508d820e6e93c9eee6aa4edf70bd32512a91727", "ja": "ふたりとも、撮影を経てとっても仲良しになった\nみたいね。まるで本当の姉妹みたい……♪", "zh": "你们两个经过这次拍摄，关系变得特别好了呢。简直就像真正的姐妹一样……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "d0cbfe9ecdc5d4bcae2a4073a9e3b9c40fd9638ef80e049dd2817eaff3ca5da3", "ja": "だったらわたし、あずささんにも、\n本当のお姉ちゃんになってほしいな！", "zh": "那我也希望，梓姐姐能成为我真正的姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "f6d16344d5a2274fafe647f6538a1979b3a67e181e8914016c2c0a50c8f4710a", "ja": "それで3人で、毎日いっしょに遊ぶの！\n楽しそうでしょ？", "zh": "然后我们3个人每天一起玩！很开心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "201bd4ccf49315d06a3be883b60d69286aeb0fec2b80b17ce71360f964b143a8", "ja": "本当に育りんが妹だったら、最高だろうな～！\n毎日一緒に走り込んだり、プランクしたり☆", "zh": "要是育琳真的是我的妹妹，那该有多棒啊～！\n每天一起跑步训练、做平板支撑☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "125ec1cf9359ae019cc1bd6ade007c589427d4f1afd38fd072d19ac54b75c89c", "ja": "{$P$}も、そう思うよねっ！？", "zh": "{$P$}也这么觉得吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a4448affe602194719194e69a29da48f64954f26a9f2fd6b8118df49f8f90a30", "ja": "うん……楽しそうな想像だけど、海美の運動量に\n育やあずささんを付き合わせるのは、ちょっと……。", "zh": "嗯……听起来是挺开心的，但要让\n育和梓小姐陪上海美的运动量，还是有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "6317201105c6e486df956fcb2d13e6220bde63312302563d6da0322533d3d00a", "ja": "じゃあ、シャイドルを見る時間だけ、\nいっしょにトレーニングするのはどう？", "zh": "那么，要不要只在看《害羞偶像》的时候一起训练？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "dbca4cee264c88a2b4047f0b59b3202e27ce153579cb79a1debc18dd2482eee4", "ja": "シャイドルって、\n育りんが好きなアニメだよね？", "zh": "Shidol，就是育林喜欢的动画吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "ce8e316866aeb334dcfb70fc4bba9c352ce0f00346256aeb4f60e3ce66c9d71d", "ja": "そう！　莉緒さんも、ヨガをやりながら、\nドラマを見たりするんだって言ってたよ。", "zh": "对！莉绪姐姐也说过，她会一边做瑜伽，一边看电视剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "a1bdedadc6430e2dbd4a42f6d1c30ac68a7996cd217690e94406ed2c051b7952", "ja": "アニメも見れて筋トレもできるなんて、一石二鳥だね☆\nじゃあさっそく、みんなでやってみよー！", "zh": "还能看动画又能锻炼肌肉，真是一举两得呢☆\n那我们马上就一起试试吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "931a67321683f0d76a98e19fef094b0862739ad3216a68ff3f2d9170c8e10870", "ja": "ふたりに、ついていけるかしら……\nお手柔らかにね、うふふ。", "zh": "不知道能不能跟上你们两个……\n手下留情哦，呜呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0164_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_14_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7f2286c8a94f4e52d152fa231aff9d06feadbc5005a986f0305533144a1b8af3", "ja": "（乙女達の一幕は、始まったばかり……。けど今は\n邪魔せずそっと、見守らせてもらう事にしよう）", "zh": "（少女们的片段才刚刚开始……不过现在还是别去打扰，悄悄守望她们吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
